  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8e3ae0b7-c0de-46b0-9ca0-7fff83d4159b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Вычислить производную для функции $f(x) = x^4 +3x^3+4x^2+8$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 18,
   "id": "4dc653ef-fd74-4b34-81be-70955a34b1c0",
   "metadata": {
    "scrolled": true
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "$\\displaystyle 4 x^{3} + 9 x^{2} + 8 x$"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "4*x**3 + 9*x**2 + 8*x"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 18,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import sympy\n",
    "x = sympy.Symbol('x')\n",
    "expr = x**4 + 3*x**3 + 4*x**2 + 8\n",
    "expr.diff(x)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3798f9e3-4271-442f-bb3c-584bed89098c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Вычислить производную для функции $f(x) = ln(x^2 + 5x) + e^{sin(x)}$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "5b6aeb50-402c-41b2-b75f-e8d62f48febc",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "$\\displaystyle \\frac{2 x + 5}{x^{2} + 5 x} + e^{\\sin{\\left(x \\right)}} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}$"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "(2*x + 5)/(x**2 + 5*x) + exp(sin(x))*cos(x)"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 8,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import sympy\n",
    "from sympy import diff, sin, exp, log, Symbol\n",
    "x = Symbol('x')\n",
    "expr = log(x**2 + 5*x) + exp(sin(x))\n",
    "expr.diff()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "54d97a55-4820-48f3-905d-25f162987b41",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "С помощью библиотеки SymPy найдите производную для функции\n",
    "$y = sin(3x + log(x))\\cdot e^x$"
   ]
  },
